     <p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">各位同学：</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">新的学习开始了，现在是否适应开学的节奏？</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">成长路上</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">或有欣喜快乐，也会有疑惑困扰</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">想了解真正的自我？想解决内心的困惑</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">、</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">学习的挫折</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">、</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">生活的困惑</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">、</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">选择的迷茫</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">？</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">——如果你无法替自己排解烦忧</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">欢迎来到博雅心苑</span><span style="font-family:宋体">·绍兴一中心理健康教育中心</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">我们坚信每一个生命都蕴含着巨大的能量，寻求帮助</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">亦</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">是一种对自己负责任的选择。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">本学期自</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">8</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">31</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">日起，学校心理健康教育中心将继续面向全体同学提供心理健康教育与辅导服务。无论你是只想找个人闲聊，还是有一点疑惑，或是内心极度痛苦，只要你愿意，都可以尝试来寻求帮助，我们将在工作规范和专业伦理的指导下，遵循保密原则，真诚提供服务，希望能够帮助到你。所有服务均免费。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">如有需要，可根据个人意愿从以下两种渠道任选其一得到帮助：</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:微软雅黑">渠道一：学校心理老师提供的心理服务</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">辅导地点：</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">树兰楼四楼</span><span style="font-family:宋体">4004博雅心苑</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">辅导老师：</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">王佩金</span><span style="font-family:宋体"> 朱垭烨</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">开放时段：</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">工作日中午</span><span style="font-family:宋体">12：30--13：20和下午最后一节课</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:80px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（其他时段按需开放，需与心理老师联系预约）</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:80px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)">
</p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">预约方式：</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">1.预约时间表：</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">在心理辅导室外设有预约时间表，请你选择辅导老师和辅导时间，在相应老师的预约时间表上打</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“√”，并按时到达心理辅导接待室与辅导老师会面。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">时间表上打</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“x”表示该时段不可预约；已打“√”的时间段代表已有预约，打“△”表示已有定期预约，请勿重复预约。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">2.当面预约：</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">请与心理老师当面商定时间。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">3.QQ:1878102103（昵称：绍中心理健康）</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，添加好友后留言个人姓名、班级、预约时间等信息。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">4.</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">心理热线</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">：</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">8517 3853</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">5.班主任：</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">通过班主任联系心理老师，商定时间。</span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">温馨提示：</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">一般情况下，辅导双方将于预约的时间段会面（超过</span><span style="font-family:宋体">15分钟未到，即为失约，请预约下次时间）。如果你临时有事，请提前告知心理老师，或至少提前两个小时在辅导室外预约时间表的备注留言区说明，并预约下次时间。如辅导师临时有事，也会备注留言，请及时关注。 </span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体"> </span></span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb(255,255,255)"><strong><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:微软雅黑">渠道二：外聘心理专家到校提供心理辅导服务。</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:150%;background:rgb